<title>SWEDEN: Finnish navy buys Bofors submarine.</title>
<headline>Finnish navy buys Bofors submarine.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bofors, a unit of defence industries group Celsius AB, said on Wednesday the Finnish navy bought a Double Eagle Mk II submarine.  </p>
<p>The submarine will be used for minesweeping, Bofors said in a statement, without disclosing the value of the order.</p>
<p>The Finnish navy will  buy it from SUTEC in Linkoping, Sweden, part of Bofors Underwater Systems, it said.</p>
<p>The Double Eagle system is estimated to be ready for delivery in early 1998.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
